    "faq_Fqyj6": {
      "type": "faq",
      "disabled": false,
      "settings": {
        "show_navigation": false,
        "title": "FULL RETURNS POLICY",
        "content": "",
        "header-26594786e9767b9e1f85b75977a4d3e8": null,
        "background": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "text_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)"
      },
      "blocks": {
        "question_eawaT": {
          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tap to view our full returns policy",
            "answer": "<p><strong>60-Day Return Policy in short</strong></p><p>You have 60 days from receipt of delivery to confirm the suitability of your item(s). Should any of your order not be suitable, please contact our Customer Support Team via <a href=\"mailto:hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</a>.<br/>Should you wish to return your order, or part of your order, this service is <strong>free </strong>up to <strong>30 days</strong> of your order being received. Should you wish to return your order between 31-60 days after receipt of your order, the carriage fee below will apply:</p><p>£20 carriage fee for return of item(s) up to the value of £499 RRP</p><p>£40 carriage fee for return of item(s) over the value of £500 RRP</p><p>Please note this charge is <strong>applied per visit.</strong></p><p>Please do not worry about returning item(s) yourself, <strong>returning item(s) are collected<br/>by William Wood Dedicated Delivery.</strong> Once your return has been confirmed, we<br/>will contact you by telephone to arrange collection.</p><p>Please keep your packaging until you have confirmed you are 100% happy with your order. Returns of products without their full original packaging, or packaging that is no longer in a resaleable condition, will be subject to a repackaging fee. Please see the <strong>FULL RETURNS POLICY</strong> under “<strong>Repackaging fees</strong>” for this breakdown. The condition of your item and packaging will be assessed using images provided via email, and checked again by your William Wood Dedicated Delivery Driver upon collection,<br/>before any refund is issued.</p><p><strong>How long will it take to receive my refund?</strong></p><p>We're leading the way in our industry and believe our customers should not have to wait long periods to receive their funds back.<br/><br/>Your refund will therefore be processed as soon as your item has been collected<br/>and inspected by your William Wood Dedicated Delivery Driver. This inspection<br/>allows us to confirm the condition of the item and packaging, and ensure the<br/>correct refund amount is issued in line with our Returns Policy.</p><p><strong>Repackaging Fees:</strong></p><p>- Products under £99 RRP: £15 (per unboxed item) fee applies</p><p>- Products £100 - £499 RRP: £30 (per unboxed item) fee applies</p><p>- Products £500 RRP and over: £45 (per unboxed item) fee applies</p><p></p><p><strong>Are there any circumstances where I may not return an item?</strong></p><p>Yes, a return may not be accepted if your product is being returned to us in a no<br/>longer ‘as new’ or is in a ‘used’ condition.</p><p> <strong>Signs of use and wear which may remove your ability to return a product:</strong></p><p>- You have wall mounted your mirror</p><p>- Your table displays signs of use and wear and tear</p><p>- Your chair displays signs of use and wear and tear</p><p>- Your product displays scuffs/marks obtained through use within your home environment</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "question_eawaT"
      ],
      "name": "FAQ"
    },
