        "7c5fe839-6e99-43c5-b659-43baa938071c": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p><strong>United Kingdom</strong></p><p>Free Delivery available throughout Mainland UK + 30 Days Free Returns</p><p>£20 Northern Ireland Delivery 7-21 days + 30 Days Free Returns</p>"
          }
        },
        "669486fa-650c-4bab-ac0c-19878d56d555": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Yes, we currently ship to Mainland UK and Northern Ireland. Our team is working tirelessly on increasing the number of locations we ship to. Follow our social @williamwood for all announcements.</p>"
          }
        },
        "94ebdd2d-764a-4103-9330-ee3b61f9d03d": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Please update us of any address changes within <strong>24 hours</strong> of your order being placed. Any address changes after this period may result in a delay in your order being shipped.</p>"
          }
        },
        "977753b3-f173-447a-ac0c-3928d5575d99": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p><strong>In stock:</strong> William Wood Dedicated Delivery will deliver your order to you within the advised shipping time to your post code area found on our delivery and returns page.<br/><br/><strong>Pre Order:</strong> If you have placed an order for a product which is available on Pre Order, please check the advised shipment week which is available to view on the product page. Once your Pre Order lands in stock, this will be delivered to you within the advised week.</p>"
          }
        },
        "896e1a1b-f795-4573-a8f3-9e389f2518c1": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>At this stage we’re unable to offer tracking. However, William Wood<br/>Dedicated Delivery is proud to offer one of the most transparent delivery<br/>services in our industry. All of our in-house drivers are fully accustomed with the difficulties of home delivery when it comes to furniture, with that in mind you can be certain that our driver will be in contact with you at least 24 hours prior to delivery. We also provide our driver's direct contact number, so if you wish to contact them in regards to your delivery please feel free to do so.</p>"
          }
        },
        "917d783b-c8d1-4e27-b670-b05d40e751d6": {
          "settings": {
            "title": "I want to exchange my order",
            "answer": "<p>Should you wish to exchange your order for another item, this service is <strong>free</strong> within up to 60 days of your order being received. Should the product you wish to exchange to be higher in price than the initial product on your order, the difference in price will be requested by our Customer Support Team. Should the product you wish to exchange to be lower in price than the initial product on your order, an exchange will be carried out. Once the initial product is returned back to our warehouse, the difference in price will be refunded back to you as soon as possible. Please note your first exchange is free. Any additional exchanges which are not a result of a product being faulty are charged at a fixed fee of £15.00.</p><p>International Orders: Due to customs regulations and duties on international orders, we are unable to process exchanges for alternative items on existing orders. Instead, we will be required to cancel your current order, allowing you to place a new one with your preferred items.</p>"
          }
        },
        "69b244eb-8c42-47b7-9408-345d94e4efe0": {
          "settings": {
            "title": "I want to return my order",
            "answer": "<p>You have 60 days from receipt of delivery to<br/>confirm the suitability of your item(s). Should any of your order not be<br/>suitable, please contact our Customer Support Team via <a href=\"mailto:hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk\">hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</a>.<br/>Should you wish to return your order, or part of your order, this service is <strong>free </strong>up to <strong>30 days</strong> of your order being received. Should you wish to return your order between 31-60 days after receipt of your order, the carriage fee below will apply</p><p>£20 carriage fee for return of item(s) up to the value of £499 RRP</p><p>£40 carriage fee for return of item(s) over the value of £500 RRP</p><p>Please note this charge is <strong>applied per visit.</strong></p><p>Please do not worry about returning item(s) yourself, <strong>returning item(s) are collected<br/>by William Wood Dedicated Delivery.</strong> Once your return has been confirmed, we will contact you by telephone to arrange collection.</p><p>Please keep your packaging until you have<br/>confirmed you are 100% happy with your order. Returns of products without their<br/>full original packaging, or packaging that is no longer in a resaleable condition, will be subject to a repackaging fee. Please see the <strong>FULL RETURNS POLICY</strong> under “<strong>Repackaging fees</strong>” for this breakdown. The condition of your item and packaging will be assessed using images provided via email, and checked again by your William Wood Dedicated Delivery Driver upon collection,<br/>before any refund is issued.</p>"
          }
        },
        "65cff28d-aa88-4ef2-a04e-c3a0791940cb": {
          "settings": {
            "title": "I want to cancel my order",
            "answer": "<p>You retain full control of your order with us at all times. Please contact <strong>hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk</strong> and our Customer Support Team will be happy to assist you. If you wish to cancel your order whilst out it's out for delivery, we can only refund your purchase once the cancelled item(s) have been received back at our warehouse.</p>"
          }
        },
        "02ccfd3b-6320-4ce8-88d3-6c62bbe44bb9": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>We're leading the way in our industry and believe our customers should not have to wait long periods to receive their funds back. Therefore, rest assured your order will be refunded as soon as it is collected.</p>"
          }
        },
        "d823a3f7-7176-4899-9d8a-3758a1800d24": {
          "settings": {
            "answer": "<p>Contact us via hello@williamwoodmirrors.co.uk and our Customer Support Team<br/>will be more than happy to assist.</p>"
          }
        }
      }
